# BASILISK EYRIE — the structure at a high-band basilisk site. Clean-room: a
# scorched crag of shell plates ringing a nest of blubber and meat, the way a
# thing that spits fire would build somewhere its own fire cannot take hold.
#
# Deliberately shell-heavy at the rim and soft in the middle: the fight is to
# get past the plating to the nest, which is the same shape as the kraken den's
# lesson (bring the ship's guns) at a lighter weight, because the top band is
# reachable earlier than the deep.
#
#   godot --headless --path . --script tools/ship_preview.gd -- ships/nest_eyrie.ship
#
#   K  shell (the crag)   M  meat (the nest)   W  blubber   |  strut
#
# ONE connected piece — a nest is broken by taking half of it apart, and a
# detached wing would fall away as its own wreck instead.

origin 4 2

.KK..KK.
KKKWWKKK
KKWMMWKK
.KWMMWK.
..K||K..
